OL,3,AIsrael re-establishes closed West Bank
OL,4,Asettlement, defying growing
OL,5,Ainternational protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new generation of Israeli settlers
OL,8,Fhas returned to the settlement of
OL,9,FKadim, in the occupied West Bank, two
OL,10,Fdecades after it was closed by a
OL,11,Fprevious Israeli government.
OL,13,FThirty "pioneer families" had arrived
OL,14,Fin the settlement on Thursday from Tel
OL,15,FAviv, according to the regional
OL,16,Fsettlers' council, riding a wave of
OL,17,FJewish nationalism driven by Israel's
OL,18,Fcurrent government.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
