CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787396126
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws           G13/41
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIsrael re-establishes closed West Bank
OL,4,Asettlement, defying growing
OL,5,Ainternational protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey came in small groups, some under
OL,8,Fmilitary escort, blue and white Israeli
OL,9,Fflags fluttering from their cars as
OL,10,Fthey passed Palestinian villages and
OL,11,Ffarmlands.  Some dragged trailers
OL,12,Floaded with bedding, furniture and
OL,13,Fbuilding material.
OL,15,FIsrael's government has overturned a
OL,16,F20-year ban on Jewish settlements
OL,17,Faround Jenin.  Palestinian residents
OL,18,Fare watching the new push on settlement
OL,19,Fexpansion here with fear.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
